{"id":"n38155-3-6","stage":4,"title":"꼭꼭 · 连续苦苦地忍受或忍耐的样子。","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38155-3-6-1","ko":"너 회사 그만두었다며?","zh":"你不是说辞职了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두었다며?","meaning":"罢休，放弃","explanation":"그만두다：罢休，放弃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"2","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두었다며","audio":"/audio/9297f3a7d2cdb1a60cea.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"罢休，放弃","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"不做打算以后要做的事情。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/76cd3c467dc17d535845.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38155-3-6-2","ko":"응. 힘든 일도 꼭꼭 참고 다녔는데 더 이상 못 견디겠더라고.","zh":"嗯。明明一直强忍着各种辛苦坚持工作，可实在再也撑不下去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"힘든","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘든","audio":"/audio/f04d3b5f291b802e4bb0.mp3"}},{"text":"일도","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일도","audio":"/audio/a24f7f49d733e1e2c1d8.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭꼭","meaning":"连续苦苦地忍受或忍耐的样子。","explanation":"꼭꼭：连续苦苦地忍受或忍耐的样子。","readings":[{"term":"꼭꼭","audio":"/audio/d1b41e6e01c67284b8de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38155","senseId":"3","lemma":"꼭꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭꼭","audio":"/audio/d1b41e6e01c67284b8de.mp3"}},{"text":"참고","meaning":"忍耐，忍受，忍住","explanation":"참다：忍耐，忍受，忍住；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"참다","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29772","senseId":"2","lemma":"참다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참고","audio":"/audio/6fe809e327f15dea0256.mp3"}},{"text":"다녔는데","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녔는데","audio":"/audio/ff4b44c88a2f7c703afe.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"이상","meaning":"既然","explanation":"이상：既然","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"3","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"견디겠더라고.","meaning":"经得住，硬挺，忍耐","explanation":"견디다：经得住，硬挺，忍耐；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"견디다","audio":"/audio/3d2b0fdac042ddf03a36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64366","senseId":"1","lemma":"견디다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"견디겠더라고","audio":"/audio/96da1d12428bd9c17947.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"d1b41e6e01c67284","term":"꼭꼭","zh":"连续苦苦地忍受或忍耐的样子。","audio":"/audio/d1b41e6e01c67284b8de.mp3","entryId":"38155","definition":"连续苦苦地忍受或忍耐的样子。","pronunciation":["꼭꼭"]},{"id":"1cfaf7914b38f877","term":"참다","zh":"忍耐，忍受，忍住","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3","entryId":"29772","definition":"抑制、控制住悲伤、恐惧、怒火等感情。","pronunciation":["참ː따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"既然","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"已经这样的话。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"3d2b0fdac042ddf0","term":"견디다","zh":"经得住，硬挺，忍耐","audio":"/audio/3d2b0fdac042ddf03a36.mp3","entryId":"64366","definition":"在辛苦困难面前忍受坚持并生活下去。","pronunciation":["견디다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a80ce6e02b23364ff66.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38155","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6623,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。明明一直强忍着各种辛苦坚持工作，可实在再也撑不下去了。","这两个人看起来挺要好的呢。","你不是说辞职了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。明明一直强忍着各种辛苦坚持工作，可实在再也撑不下去了。","你不是说辞职了吗？","这两个人看起来挺要好的呢。"],"answer":0}]}
